Redirect the customer to the returned checkout_url. The card form is rendered on Debito Pay's domain (PCI-DSS, 3D Secure, anti-fraud) — card data never touches your server or frontend. After payment, the customer is returned to your return_url with ?status=success or ?status=failed.

Recurring (subscription) is supported only for Visa/Mastercard via tokenization — managed by the subscription-engine.
